kosha count-remaining

  -- count-remaining: the result of subtracting one count from another.
  -- "how many remaining", "how many left", "how many after giving away"
  -- → solve-for = count-remaining → matches count-sub-mantra (phala: count-remaining)
  --
  -- this is distinct from bare "count" so that match-mantra can
  -- discriminate subtraction from addition.

  "number-varga-vishesa"
  "math-varga-vishesa"
  "count-yukta"
  "subtraction-yukta"

  "sankhya-swarupa"
  "count-abheda"         -- count-remaining IS-A count

  shabda word:remaining,left,after,rest,leftover / the-remaining-count-after-subtraction

done
